# F0 (ADR 0057 D3, review finding S1): files whose bytes enter an identity are checked out with LF
# on every platform, so a self-hash (`implementation_sha256`, a model's `artifact_hash`), a data or
# record SHA, a lock SHA or a fixture digest never depends on the checkout's line endings.
*.py                text eol=lf
*.pyi               text eol=lf
*.json              text eol=lf
*.yaml              text eol=lf
*.yml               text eol=lf
*.csv               text eol=lf
*.toml              text eol=lf
*.lock              text eol=lf
*.md                text eol=lf
